      "content": "it just feels like a cycle that never ends. they try to be nice, but i can see it in their eyes. the frustration. the way they sigh when i cant even do basic stuff. it's like i'm just a constant drain on their energy and their lives. i hate that i'm the reason they can't just be happy or free. it feels selfish just to keep existing like this.",
